<Paragraph paddingTop="6" paddingBottom="6" align="center">MindSync is growing for you, thanks to you.</Paragraph>
<Image src="https://images.vialoops.com/cms091k4c0d270jzyr9585vs7/cms091k7r0d2b0jzyfxhbkfdj.png" width="552" paddingTop="6" paddingBottom="6" />
